<Base title="Apps" current="apps">
  <h1>Apps</h1>
  <p>Examples of the bespoke work I build. Each one started as a specific problem and was shaped around how it's used day to day.</p>

  <h2><a href="https://recipes.junipernine.com">Recipe app</a></h2>
  <p>A searchable library of recipes extracted from cookbooks, with a review step before anything goes live.</p>

  <h2><a href="https://photos.junipernine.com">Photo curator</a></h2>
  <p>A fully customisable tool that brings the photos you keep in cloud storage together in one place. It helps you organise a large library with duplicate detection and a review workflow, and it's built for one household, so it isn't publicly available.</p>

  <p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Describe your project</a></p>
